 {
  "id": "71:10",
  "name": "The core color scheme will consist of two primary colors that is incorporated into our logo, main headers, and gradients. The first color is a true red, and the second color is a bright yellow. While we officially have two main colors, we frequently mix these colors to create hues of orange, as depicted in our secondary palette.",
